(Venture Idea: QuickMess is a mobile-first pre-ordering platform for campus mess and canteens. Students view the) Tj
T* (daily menu, choose a pickup time slot, and order in advance, then collect food from a dedicated counter without) Tj
T* (standing in queues. A built-in menu voting feature lets students indicate which dishes they will eat, helping) Tj
T* (kitchens cook closer to actual demand and reduce food wastage. Unlike generic food delivery apps, QuickMess) Tj
T* (works inside campus, has zero delivery fees, supports hostel meal plans, and is designed around class timetables) Tj
T* (and short break windows.) Tj
